  "name": "Ninja's Focus keeps one Agility buff per enchanted weapon (#10946)",
  "contract": [
    "#10946: Scroll of Enchant Weapon - Ninja's Focus (967770) casts 968686, enchant 5115, whose equip spell",
    "968716 (Ninja's Focus II) gives each enchanted weapon its own proc aura: a 25% chance on spells and",
    "abilities to cast the 15 s +110 Agility buff 968746. The PR author's review on 2026-11-24 of original",
    "Ascension footage (https://youtu.be/6kBk2joQmwQ) shows both weapons' buffs active at once, each proccing on",
    "its own. The server cast the buff without its weapon and did not keep it per weapon, so a second weapon's",
    "proc only refreshed the first buff and the gain never exceeded 110 Agility. A Mage with both one-handers",
    "enchanted and equipped casts Arcane Explosion on ten dummies five times: each cast rolls each weapon's aura",
    "ten times, so the chance that a weapon has no buff after the last cast is below 0.75^10 = 6% per cast and",
    "below 1e-6 over five casts; Agility then reads 220 above the baseline (two buffs). Before the repair it",
    "cannot exceed 110, so the check fails."
  ],
